# JUMMY ≈ Jimbo Understands My Mumbling… Yeah??  (one-line criteria below)
# "in Ante N" = only that ante; ante 1 checks four booster slots, ante 2+ checks six.
# "by Ante N" = search run through antes 1…N (cumulative).

jummy: 1

name: Jimbo mumble demo
description: >
  Eternal Blueprint in ante 1 (four booster packs that ante).
  Perishable Egg anywhere through ante 4 (antes 1–4, all relevant pack slots).

deck: Red
stake: White

must:
  - Eternal Blueprint in Ante 1
  - Perishable Egg by Ante 4
